    <p>Welcome to The Network!</p>
    <p>
      Rather than opting for making an entire publication, I decided to make a private network.
    </p>
    <p>
      You may be wondering why! Glad you asked...
    </p>
    <p>
      The most obvious reason is that there are a bunch of things I want to share that I can't share publicly. Additionally, I realized that I'd much rather build genuine relationships with people than broadcast out to a bunch of strangers.
    </p>
    <p>
      So want to connect? <a href='mailto: holler@nickoneill.com'>Shoot me an email</a> and introduce yourself!
    </p>
